      "output": "`REQUIREMENTS.md` has been written to the project root. Here's a summary of what was captured:\n\n---\n\n### REQUIREMENTS.md — Key Decisions & Assumptions\n\n**Tech Stack Assumed**\n- Turborepo 2.x + pnpm workspaces\n- React 18 + TypeScript 5 (strict mode)\n- Ant Design 5.x with a dark space-theme `ConfigProvider`\n- Vite 5.x as the bundler for `apps/web`\n- React Router v6 for client-side routing\n\n**Monorepo Structure**\n- `apps/web` — the main React application\n- `packages/ui` — shared component library (Navbar, Footer, Hero, FeatureCard, ContactForm, etc.)\n\n**Pages Specified**\n- `/` Landing Page: Hero → Features Grid → Mission Strip → CTA Banner → Footer\n- `/contact` Contact Page: Contact Form (with full Ant Design validation) + Company Info Block\n\n**Design Direction**\n- Dark minimalist palette: near-black background (`#0A0A0F`), electric blue accent (`#4F8EF7`), off-white text\n- Generous whitespace, clean typography, no decorative clutter\n\n**7 Open Questions** documented in Section 10, including: company name, package manager choice (pnpm vs npm), Vite vs Next.js, hero background image vs CSS gradient, and future backend API plans.",
      "error": null,
      "parentId": null,
      "childIds": [
        "c5f3fac6-fd7e-467d-91c3-69f0631ea5b0"
